## Fixed genes (signature, id, description, calls)
- goals() -> Tiles  [s2] where to walk: a free altar once the bag holds 10 gems, else a living camp group other than golems and monoliths, gem clusters first when close, narrow gem margin
- goal_field() -> Field  [s3] distance field to the goals; home when hurt and empty-handed; calls goals
- cast_value(o: Option) -> Num  [Z6a] value of casting an ability: damage and stuns on fighting targets, shields and resets in fights, dash toward goals or away from danger; calls progress, threat_at
- threat_at(t: Tile) -> Num  [Z44a] how many awake camps and enemy champions could hit a tile
- chase_gain(t: Tile) -> Num  [Z77a] how much closer a step brings me to the weakest visible enemy champion when it is hurt and I am healthy

## EDITABLE gene score (called by the fixed loop)
```python
@gene('Z105a', 'value of doing this option now: draft a ranged team, cast abilities, farm camps until 10 gems, recall when safe, retreat from threats when hurt, earlier recall and retreat, finish awake camps, wake new ones only when healthy, later recall and retreat, focus hurt and gem-carrying champions', parents=['s1'])
def score(o: Option) -> Num:
    if o.kind == PICK:
        if o.champ == VESPER_VALE:
            return 10
        if o.champ == STELLAR:
            return 9
        if o.champ == TAVI:
            return 8
        if o.champ == CASSI:
            return 7
        if o.champ == WILLOW:
            return 6
        return 1
    if o.kind == BUY:
        return 100 + item_strength(o.item) if item_cost(o.item) >= 22 and item_strength(o.item) > 0 else 0
    if o.kind == RECALL:
        return 90 if me().health_frac < 0.25 and threat_at(me().pos) == 0 else 0
    if o.kind == CAST:
        return cast_value(o)
    if o.kind == ATTACK:
        if o.unit.is_champion:
            return 80 + 5 * (1 - o.unit.health_frac) + (3 if unit_gems(o.unit) > 0 else 0)
        return 60 if (gems() < 10 or is_awake(o.unit)) and (is_awake(o.unit) or me().health_frac > 0.5) else 0
    if o.kind == TRIBUTE:
        return 70
    if o.kind == MOVE:
        if me().health_frac < 0.3 and threat_at(me().pos) > 0:
            return 104 if threat_at(o.tile) < threat_at(me().pos) else 0
        if chase_gain(o.tile) > 0:
            return 55
        return 50 if progress(o.tile) > 0 else 0
    return 0
```

## EDITABLE gene progress (called by cast_value, score)
```python
@gene("s4", "how much closer a step brings me to the goals")
def progress(t: Tile) -> Num:
    return at(goal_field(), me().pos) - at(goal_field(), t)
```

## EDITABLE gene consider (called by the fixed loop)
```python
@gene('Z33a', 'which option kinds to list at all: skip wards, locks and cancels to save fuel', parents=['s1'])
def consider(kind: Num) -> Bool:
    return kind != WARD and kind != LOCK and kind != BUY_LOCK and kind != CANCEL
